{"id": "thirteen-unreported-federal-subawards", "title": "Thirteen federal subawards were missing from the City’s reports", "seconds": 45.5, "voice": "tinyvoca:M2", "narrator": "Temporary local narration", "made": "2026-11-28", "key": "44e7ff7fcb5ba769", "words": 142, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "compare", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "A federal grant can pass through the City before another organization spends it.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.07, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "compare", "rows": [["Continuum of Care", "12"], ["Workforce pilot", "1"]]}}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The public register was meant to show that next step.", "t0": 4.19, "t1": 6.68, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "rule", "kicker": "Federal disclosure had a $25,000 threshold", "text": "Public register", "mark": "Public"}}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The reporting threshold at the time was $25,000.", "t0": 6.8, "t1": 10.08, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$25,000", "label": "Federal disclosure had a $25,000 threshold"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Auditors found 12 unreported homelessness awards and one workforce award.", "t0": 10.3, "t1": 14.31, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "original", "kicker": "Thirteen covered awards were missing", "text": "13 awards", "mark": "13"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "They assigned no questioned costs.", "t0": 14.43, "t1": 16.18, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "No questioned costs"}}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The City said the workforce reports were filed later.", "t0": 16.3, "t1": 18.9, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "response", "kicker": "The City reported a 